## 6. What this adds over the established machinery

The antecedents matter to the interpretation.

Petz transposition supplies the deterministic reconstruction operation. Matsumoto’s minimal reverse test is exactly the binary commutative specialization of the canonical lift. Hiai–Mosonyi already establish the maximal-divergence equality mechanism and its separation from ordinary reversibility. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="2"}

Canonical noncommutative moment invariants also have substantial precedent: Guţă–Jenčová use Connes-cocycle moments for ordinary statistical equivalence. The invariant here uses normalized channel-output generators and defines a different equality class, whose greatest lift can strictly improve ordinary decision performance. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="3"}

CP extension and scaling into probabilistic operations are established, as is finite word-space closure for equivalence testing. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="4"}

**The combined result proved here is the complete channel-profile classification, its class-wide greatest physical realization, and the exact rational compiler for that realization and its converters.** The literature search also included the October 2026 retrodictive-test framework, which treats prescribed states and references through Petz transposition; I kept that scope distinct from this whole-channel classification. :chatgpt-content-reference{index="5"}

I am not claiming established historical priority. The proof and constructions stand on their stated mathematics without making external approval a gate.
